# Local build outputs must never enter an image: a host obj/project.assets.json
# restored without a runtime identifier breaks `dotnet publish -r linux-x64`.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml

.git/
.github/
.claude/
.env
terraform/
helm/
k8s/
tests/
reporter/tests/
